        "content": "## Invoice Process\nA new invoice PDF is added to the Google Drive folder. \nThe file is downloaded and its text is extracted. \nAI reads the text and pulls out the invoice details. \nThe invoice is saved to Supabase. Each line item is then saved to Supabase and linked to that invoice.",
